        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133700/extras/34fff2f5a96ec568896fed41e67f416a.poster.avif?t=1763992321\" width=614 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133700/extras/34fff2f5a96ec568896fed41e67f416a.webm?t=1763992321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133700/extras/34fff2f5a96ec568896fed41e67f416a.mp4?t=1763992321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dwarf Tavern, each day is divided into two phases:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 1: Preparation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine tunnels and elevator shafts, build tables, install lights, and decorate walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design menus for meals and drinks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients and materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff and assign their tasks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 2: Running the Tavern</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook meals and brew drinks, serve customers, and clean the floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money, build your reputation, and level up to unlock new recipes and blueprints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break up fights to prevent tables from being destroyed</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133700/extras/34fff2f5a96ec568896fed41e67f416a.poster.avif?t=1763992321\" width=614 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133700/extras/34fff2f5a96ec568896fed41e67f416a.webm?t=1763992321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133700/extras/34fff2f5a96ec568896fed41e67f416a.mp4?t=1763992321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dwarf Tavern, each day is divided into two phases:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 1: Preparation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine tunnels and elevator shafts, build tables, install lights, and decorate walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design menus for meals and drinks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients and materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff and assign their tasks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase 2: Running the Tavern</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook meals and brew drinks, serve customers, and clean the floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money, build your reputation, and level up to unlock new recipes and blueprints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break up fights to prevent tables from being destroyed</p></li></ul>",
